t expect it will be a grotesque and painful event the moment it starts.\n\nThe Feast is an invitation to a bizarre family dinner party that takes an unexpected turn. Join the most surreal meal of your life, discover what you truly stand for, and create your own tragic spectacle in this short thought-inspiring and unforgettable adventure with multiple endings.", "summary": "The Feast is a short and intensely dramatic experience designed to be completed in one sitting (20-30 minutes).\n\nThis dark and peculiar spectacle grants you the lead role. In a theatrical setting, survive the utterly confusing and twisted dinner. You will be observed and judged, so face reality, weigh every action, consider possible outcomes, make choices - and define the conclusion of this life-changing celebration.\n\nAfter all, what happens here is not your problem\u2026\n\u2026 or is it?", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-feast--1", "videos": [{"id": 154506, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "cWUyT7XaMK0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cWUyT7XaMK0", "title": "The Feast | Launch Trailer [GOG]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cWUyT7XaMK0/sddefault.jpg"}]}